0/extras/a6587366afd5019f0e43ee90bae3f500.webm?t=1786371583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882720/extras/a6587366afd5019f0e43ee90bae3f500.mp4?t=1786371583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882720/extras/4a868f132e2d852026fae30b1c55816c.avif?t=1786371583\" alt=\"Untangle the truth\" width=780 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the plague lies something more sinister than just nightmares. Unravel an insidious conspiracy to learn the truth behind the plague and if it can be stopped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882720/extras/cdce9261136b336fd76bb6f1314900aa.poster.avif?t=1786371583\" width=780 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882720/extras/cdce9261136b336fd76bb6f1314900aa.webm?t=1786371583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882720/extras/cdce9261136b336fd76bb6f1314900aa.mp4?t=1786371583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882720/extras/1c44d1a0d7b3d635fa1adf9f20868428.avif?t=1786371583\" alt=\"\"width=780 height=67 /></span></p>", "short_description": "When a city falls to a sleeping plague, nightmares rise up. Awaken the city as a mortician’s daughter who walks the line between the sleeping and the waking. Fight through the dreams, seal the rifts, make choices that chip away at who she is, try to become the nightmare that nightmares fear.", "supported_languages